        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">FEMA P-361 & ICC-500 Compliant</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">All our commercial safe rooms are engineered and installed to meet the highest federal and industry standards for near-absolute protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
